# `sample_with_bugs.py` — API Reference

> **Module:** `sample_input.sample_with_bugs`  
> **Purpose:** Demonstrates common Python bugs (off-by-one, attribute access, race conditions) for use by the **code-review team** and **documentation pipeline**.  
> **Status:** ⚠️ _Contains intentional bugs_ — see [Known Issues](#known-issues) below.

---

